{"cells":[{"kind":1,"languageId":"markdown","value":"# Vue Frontend Setup\n\n**Requirements:** JavaScript package manager (e.g., yarn)\n\n**Important:** The Vite dev server must be started BEFORE the Django runserver command.","metadata":{}},{"kind":2,"languageId":"shellscript","value":"# Navigate to vue3 directory\ncd vue3","metadata":{}},{"kind":2,"languageId":"shellscript","value":"# Install JavaScript dependencies\nyarn install","metadata":{}},{"kind":2,"languageId":"shellscript","value":"# Start dev server for live updates (run this FIRST before Django)\nyarn dev","metadata":{}},{"kind":2,"languageId":"shellscript","value":"# Alternative: compile assets once if not modifying pages\n# yarn build","metadata":{}}]}